OL,5,MPOLL TAX HAD ITS PROBLEMS - HESELTINE
OL,7, 109FCollection could have been better
OL,8, 110FLamont denies U-turn on Thatcherism
OL,9, 108FTories "incompetent" over poll tax
OL,11, 114 S AFRICAF12 die in police-ANC clash
